Release Manager demo — §40 environments, §41 approval gates, §77 snapshots/rollback

=== Environments (§40) ===
  env-local  LOCAL  policy=none  secrets=[none]  health=script:process exit code 0
  env-dev  DEV  policy=none  secrets=[dev-secrets]  health=http:/healthz → 200
  env-uat  UAT  policy=ai  secrets=[uat-secrets]  health=http:/healthz → 200, then smoke tests
  env-prod  PROD  policy=human  secrets=[prod-secrets]  health=http:/healthz → 200, then smoke tests + canary check
  (secretRefs are reference names only — never values)

